  "description": "Always fighting, yet somehow friends, they ended up causing trouble. Do-Ha is an Alpha, Geo an Omega, yet they've been childhood friends since they were little. One day, a rut hits Do-Ha, and just then, Geo happens to drop by his house and runs into him... \n\nWith his memory of that night hazy due to the Rut, Do-Ha watches Geo retching and thinks. It seems he ended up on top of Geo, but seeing no sign of a condom...\n\n *“So... I'll... take responsibility...!!”*\n\nPlease, just talk it out... No, Let's have a talk!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
